## 🧩 Component Hierarchy Example

* The root component is usually `App.tsx`.
* You can create a child component like `Message` and include it inside `App`.

  ```tsx
  // App.tsx
  import Message from './Message';

  function App() {
    return (
      <div>
        <Message />
      </div>
    );
  }

  export default App;
  ```

